WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:02.635
-The President of
the United States threatened

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:04.603
to unleash the military
on American citizens

00:00:04.603 --> 00:00:07.407
protesting the brutal
police murder of George Floyd.

00:00:07.407 --> 00:00:09.842
For more on this, it's time
for "A Closer Look."

00:00:09.842 --> 00:00:13.780
♪♪

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:15.315
Donald Trump's speech last night

00:00:15.315 --> 00:00:17.150
was one of the most
menacing moments

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:18.951
in his 3 1/2 years as
president,

00:00:18.951 --> 00:00:20.352
and that's saying a lot,

00:00:20.352 --> 00:00:22.088
given that he is always
menacing.

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:25.124
Remember during the debates
when he stalked Hillary Clinton

00:00:25.124 --> 00:00:26.893
like a "Naked and Afraid"
contestant

00:00:26.893 --> 00:00:28.494
trying to sneak up on a bird?

00:00:28.494 --> 00:00:30.730
I mean, half the time it looks
like he's on a chain

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:33.065
in the front yard
scaring away a mailman.

00:00:33.065 --> 00:00:36.235
He only has two modes --
menacing sociopath,

00:00:36.235 --> 00:00:38.237
or limp French fry
that's been sitting

00:00:38.237 --> 00:00:40.273
in the bottom of the bag
soaking up all the oil.

00:00:40.273 --> 00:00:43.242
And last night he cycled
through both of them.

00:00:43.242 --> 00:00:45.644
in turns threatening to unleash
the military

00:00:45.644 --> 00:00:47.447
on American citizens
within our borders,

00:00:47.447 --> 00:00:50.583
and at other times, listlessly
reading on of a teleprompter

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:52.385
like he just finished
a Thanksgiving meal

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:54.988
of Turkey with
Sudafed stuffing.

00:00:54.988 --> 00:00:58.657
-America needs creation,
not destruction.

00:00:58.657 --> 00:01:01.193
Cooperation, not contempt.

00:01:01.193 --> 00:01:04.397
Security, not anarchy.

00:01:04.397 --> 00:01:07.199
Healing, not hatred.

00:01:07.199 --> 00:01:10.369
Justice, not chaos.

00:01:10.369 --> 00:01:12.538
-[ As Trump ]
"Coke, not Pepsi.

00:01:12.538 --> 00:01:15.074
McDonald's, not Wendy's.

00:01:15.074 --> 00:01:17.476
Pizza Hut, not Domino's.

00:01:17.476 --> 00:01:20.045
But if there's no Pizza Hut,
Domino's is fine."

00:01:20.045 --> 00:01:22.181
He's reading a speech in the
middle of a national crisis

00:01:22.181 --> 00:01:24.850
like a 13-year-old reading from
the Torah at a bar mitzvah.

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:27.620
Can someone at least show him
these speeches

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:29.321
before he reads it cold
off a teleprompter,

00:01:29.321 --> 00:01:32.191
like he's getting his vision
tested at the DMV?

00:01:32.191 --> 00:01:35.127
"E, S, M, Q.

00:01:35.127 --> 00:01:37.062
Oh, we love Q.

00:01:37.062 --> 00:01:38.598
Oh, we love the Q,
don't we, folks?

00:01:38.598 --> 00:01:41.100
So many great words use the Q.

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:42.468
Quiznos.

00:01:42.468 --> 00:01:44.604
Hydroxychloroquine.

00:01:44.604 --> 00:01:46.105
Quick!"

00:01:46.105 --> 00:01:48.841
But when he wasn't mindlessly
reading off empty platitudes,

00:01:48.841 --> 00:01:52.111
he was adopting a much darker
and more sinister tone,

00:01:52.111 --> 00:01:54.614
threatening to sic the
military on American citizens

00:01:54.614 --> 00:01:57.216
and violently crack down on
nationwide protests

00:01:57.216 --> 00:01:59.519
over the murder of yet another
unarmed black man

00:01:59.519 --> 00:02:01.220
at the hands of police.

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:04.891
-Today I have strongly
recommended to every governor

00:02:04.891 --> 00:02:08.327
to deploy the National Guard

00:02:08.327 --> 00:02:13.065
in sufficient numbers
that we dominate the streets.

00:02:13.065 --> 00:02:16.302
Mayors and governors must
establish an overwhelming

00:02:16.302 --> 00:02:20.639
law enforcement presence until
the violence has been quelled.

00:02:20.639 --> 00:02:23.709
If a city or state refuses
to take the actions

00:02:23.709 --> 00:02:27.146
that are necessary to defend
the life and property

00:02:27.146 --> 00:02:28.714
of their residents,

00:02:28.714 --> 00:02:32.085
then I will deploy
the United States military

00:02:32.085 --> 00:02:35.287
and quickly solve
the problem for them.

00:02:35.287 --> 00:02:37.389
-I know our brains have
all melted

00:02:37.389 --> 00:02:39.425
from the constant
flagrant lawlessness

00:02:39.425 --> 00:02:41.226
and overall weirdness of this
administration,

00:02:41.226 --> 00:02:43.062
and nothing feels real
anymore

00:02:43.062 --> 00:02:45.631
and we're all just programmed
to move on to the next thing

00:02:45.631 --> 00:02:48.701
because Trump will inevitably do
something bizarre the next day,

00:02:48.701 --> 00:02:50.770
like throw a tantrum
in the Rose Garden

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:54.306
or rub up against the flag like
a horny 16-year-old at prom.

00:02:54.306 --> 00:02:56.709
But this is a horrifying
moment.

00:02:56.709 --> 00:02:58.844
You know how over 3 1/2 years
everyone was warning

00:02:58.844 --> 00:03:01.180
about the inevitable
worst-case scenario

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:02.682
where our democracy crumbles

00:03:02.682 --> 00:03:05.317
and our country descends
into authoritarianism?

00:03:05.317 --> 00:03:07.820
That worst-case scenario is
here, it's happening.

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:10.056
You're not going to get an
invitation in the mail

00:03:10.056 --> 00:03:13.058
asking you to RSVP to the
"Democracy is Over" party.

00:03:13.058 --> 00:03:15.061
There's no on/off switch.

00:03:15.061 --> 00:03:18.331
Democracy, it turns out,
is on a dimmer.

00:03:18.331 --> 00:03:19.999
This is what it looks like.

00:03:19.999 --> 00:03:22.334
In fact, last night police
violently attacked

00:03:22.334 --> 00:03:24.504
peaceful protesters
lawfully exercising

00:03:24.504 --> 00:03:26.172
their First Amendment rights

00:03:26.172 --> 00:03:29.675
just so Trump could walk over
to a church for a photo op.

00:03:29.675 --> 00:03:33.379
-Within the last 15 minutes,
mounted police have been coming

00:03:33.379 --> 00:03:35.815
down the street, you're going to
see them in the frame now,

00:03:35.815 --> 00:03:37.983
using flash bangs
in front of them,

00:03:37.983 --> 00:03:40.886
and mounted police
to clear what has been

00:03:40.886 --> 00:03:43.689
an entirely peaceful protest.

00:03:43.689 --> 00:03:45.291
Not 98%...
[ Flash bangs bursting ]

00:03:45.291 --> 00:03:50.129
...not 99%, but 100%
peaceful protest here today.

00:03:50.129 --> 00:03:53.065
People throwing -- there was
no throwing of water bottles,

00:03:53.065 --> 00:03:55.200
there was no throwing
of objects.

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:58.004
But a short time ago,
mounted police officers

00:03:58.004 --> 00:03:59.605
have been clearing the street.

00:03:59.605 --> 00:04:01.040
Tony, if you can pan
to the right,

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:02.408
I want to show the
military police --

00:04:02.408 --> 00:04:03.576
-We live in
a Third-World country!

00:04:03.576 --> 00:04:04.743
-I want to show
the military police

00:04:04.743 --> 00:04:06.011
on the side of the street.

00:04:06.011 --> 00:04:09.482
Over the last half hour,
we've had military police,

00:04:09.482 --> 00:04:11.416
we've had Secret Service
officers,

00:04:11.416 --> 00:04:12.985
we've had park police,

00:04:12.985 --> 00:04:15.521
and now we've
had National Guardsmen.

00:04:15.521 --> 00:04:19.591
You can see these officers
aiming at the protesters

00:04:19.591 --> 00:04:21.160
who are here in the park.

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:23.262
-Military police
in your country

00:04:23.262 --> 00:04:25.732
attacked peaceful protesters,
not looters,

00:04:25.732 --> 00:04:29.034
to stop them from exercising
their First Amendment rights.

00:04:29.034 --> 00:04:31.070
Trump couldn't have done more
damage to the Constitution

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:32.738
last night if he'd pulled
a Sinead O'Connor

00:04:32.738 --> 00:04:34.273
and ripped it up
on live television

00:04:34.273 --> 00:04:35.775
and then ate the pieces.

00:04:35.775 --> 00:04:38.277
This moment probably seemed
far off

00:04:38.277 --> 00:04:40.680
when the extent of Trump's
lawlessness was just

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:43.148
paying off porn stars
or colluding with Russia

00:04:43.148 --> 00:04:45.818
or sending the Soviet
Super Mario Brothers over here

00:04:45.818 --> 00:04:47.920
to get Ukraine to interfere
in our election.

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:49.655
But he got away
with all of that.

00:04:49.655 --> 00:04:52.357
He got away with all of that,
and now the moment has arrived.

00:04:52.357 --> 00:04:55.061
Because the only lesson Trump
has learned through all of this

00:04:55.061 --> 00:04:56.929
is he can get away with
whatever he wants.

00:04:56.929 --> 00:04:59.732
The president used police to
violently attack

00:04:59.732 --> 00:05:02.167
a peaceful protest just so he
could walk over to a church

00:05:02.167 --> 00:05:05.504
where even the clergy
fiercely condemned him.

00:05:05.504 --> 00:05:07.973
And hold up a Bible in front of
the cameras like a fourth grader

00:05:07.973 --> 00:05:10.443
who forgot about show-and-tell
until the last minute.

00:05:10.443 --> 00:05:13.246
You can tell he's a man of faith
from the way he holds the Bible

00:05:13.246 --> 00:05:15.047
like he's selling it on QVC.

00:05:15.047 --> 00:05:17.316
It wasn't even his,
and he didn't seem to know

00:05:17.316 --> 00:05:18.918
where it came from.

00:05:18.918 --> 00:05:21.754
A reporter asked him about it
and this was his answer.

00:05:21.754 --> 00:05:24.990
-Is that your Bible?
-It's a Bible.

00:05:24.990 --> 00:05:27.326
-Why so vague?
Did you steal from it a hotel?

00:05:27.326 --> 00:05:29.529
He holds it like he's never held
a Bible before in his life.

00:05:29.529 --> 00:05:31.431
He probably doesn't know
how to read it either.

00:05:31.431 --> 00:05:33.266
Based on his grasp of
Christianity,

00:05:33.266 --> 00:05:35.367
he probably reads it upside down
and backwards.

00:05:35.367 --> 00:05:37.103
"Lot's wife
was a pillar of salt,

00:05:37.103 --> 00:05:40.606
but then she looked back at
Sodom, cured just like that."

00:05:40.606 --> 00:05:42.775
Clergy at the church denounced
Trump's actions toward

00:05:42.775 --> 00:05:45.344
protesters and his use of
the church for a photo op.

00:05:45.344 --> 00:05:47.480
And in case you think maybe
the people around Trump

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:49.615
will just ignore his lawless
authoritarianism,

00:05:49.615 --> 00:05:51.950
the Chairman of the Joint
Chiefs, a four-star general,

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:54.387
was patrolling the streets
of D.C. last night.

00:05:54.387 --> 00:05:57.023
The Defense Secretary told
governors responding to protests

00:05:57.023 --> 00:05:59.224
that they, quote, "Need to
dominate the battle space."

00:05:59.224 --> 00:06:01.760
A U.S. Senator was calling on
the president to send in

00:06:01.760 --> 00:06:04.396
lethal military units to subdue
protesters.

00:06:04.396 --> 00:06:07.033
And military helicopters also
performed a show of force

00:06:07.033 --> 00:06:09.301
maneuver that is often used in
combat zones

00:06:09.301 --> 00:06:10.869
to scare away insurgents.

00:06:10.869 --> 00:06:13.806
They're treating protesters
like insurgents.

00:06:13.806 --> 00:06:16.709
Honestly, how long until Trump
coasts down Pennsylvania Avenue

00:06:16.709 --> 00:06:20.479
on top of a tank in a mouse suit
and a bunch of Gaddafi scarves?

00:06:20.479 --> 00:06:23.649
What we're seeing now is part
the result of a cult-like

00:06:23.649 --> 00:06:25.952
political ideology
that venerates violence

00:06:25.952 --> 00:06:28.554
and blithely elevated
an authoritarian strongman

00:06:28.554 --> 00:06:31.857
who openly fantasizes
about armed conflict.

00:06:31.857 --> 00:06:33.659
For as long as he's been
a public figure,

00:06:33.659 --> 00:06:35.428
Trump has also been
an armchair thug

00:06:35.428 --> 00:06:36.895
who glorifies violence.

00:06:36.895 --> 00:06:38.564
For example, and this is
a true story,

00:06:38.564 --> 00:06:40.900
Trump used to fast-forward
through

00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:44.003
[bleep] Jean-Claude Van Damme
movies so he could just watch

00:06:44.003 --> 00:06:46.271
the violent parts
without any plot.

00:06:46.271 --> 00:06:48.441
A "New Yorker" writer who
traveled with Trump on his plane

00:06:48.441 --> 00:06:50.777
in the '90s wrote, "that he
brought along 'Michael,'

00:06:50.777 --> 00:06:53.779
a recent release, but 20 minutes
after popping it into the VCR,

00:06:53.779 --> 00:06:55.581
he got bored and switched
to an old favorite,

00:06:55.581 --> 00:06:58.350
a Jean-Claude Van Damme slugfest
called 'Bloodsport'

00:06:58.350 --> 00:07:01.320
which he pronounced an
incredible, fantastic movie

00:07:01.320 --> 00:07:03.956
by assigning to his son the task
of fast-forwarding through

00:07:03.956 --> 00:07:06.425
all the plot exposition,
Trump's goal being

00:07:06.425 --> 00:07:09.594
'to get this two-hour movie
down to 45 minutes.'

00:07:09.594 --> 00:07:12.564
He eliminated any lulls between
the nose-hammering,

00:07:12.564 --> 00:07:15.301
kidney-tenderizing,
and shin-whacking."

00:07:15.301 --> 00:07:19.572
Trump brought along a VCR copy
of the 1996 movie "Michael"

00:07:19.572 --> 00:07:21.574
starring John Travolta
as an archangel

00:07:21.574 --> 00:07:23.943
whose main mission on Earth
is to get the main characters

00:07:23.943 --> 00:07:26.979
to fall in love,
and he bailed after 20 minutes.

00:07:26.979 --> 00:07:30.582
"He's an angel? I thought this
was about a man pigeon.

00:07:30.582 --> 00:07:33.252
The cover looks like
a man pigeon.

00:07:33.252 --> 00:07:37.990
Oh, I mean, just imagine the
damage a man pigeon would do."

00:07:37.990 --> 00:07:39.424
Also, what part of "Bloodsport"

00:07:39.424 --> 00:07:40.959
could even be fast-forwarding
through anyway?

00:07:40.959 --> 00:07:43.762
Was there a subplot in
"Bloodsport" I'm not remembering

00:07:43.762 --> 00:07:46.966
where Van Damme gives up
ninjitsu to focus

00:07:46.966 --> 00:07:48.600
on his love of pottery making?

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:50.836
That's why he sits around
barfing up psychotic tweets

00:07:50.836 --> 00:07:53.405
where he threatens protesters
with vicious dogs

00:07:53.405 --> 00:07:54.707
and ominous weapons.

00:07:54.707 --> 00:07:57.710
Remember, this is a guy who also
emulates dictators,

00:07:57.710 --> 00:08:00.279
who praised China for the
Tiananmen Square massacre,

00:08:00.279 --> 00:08:03.382
and who has repeatedly claimed
he's the most militaristic

00:08:03.382 --> 00:08:04.817
person who's ever existed,

00:08:04.817 --> 00:08:06.919
whatever the hell that's
supposed to mean.

00:08:06.919 --> 00:08:09.488
-I am the most militaristic
person.

00:08:09.488 --> 00:08:12.091
I would say I am the most
militaristic person

00:08:12.091 --> 00:08:13.325
on that stage.

00:08:13.325 --> 00:08:16.362
I am the most
militaristic person

00:08:16.362 --> 00:08:18.230
you've ever had on your show,
believe me, okay?

00:08:18.230 --> 00:08:20.499
I'm the most militaristic
person ever.

00:08:20.499 --> 00:08:23.035
I am the most military-based

00:08:23.035 --> 00:08:25.271
and the most militaristic
person on your show.

00:08:25.271 --> 00:08:27.005
-All right, first of all,
it's just, you know,

00:08:27.005 --> 00:08:28.374
an insane thing
to brag about.

00:08:28.374 --> 00:08:29.842
Even actual military people

00:08:29.842 --> 00:08:31.377
don't call themselves
militaristic.

00:08:31.377 --> 00:08:33.645
It's their job, not their
entire personality.

00:08:33.645 --> 00:08:37.149
Chefs don't describe themselves
as being very knife-oriented.

00:08:37.149 --> 00:08:39.685
Second, you're not.
You just aren't.

00:08:39.685 --> 00:08:41.887
You were never in the military,
you dodged the draft,

00:08:41.887 --> 00:08:43.655
and you can't even
stand upright.

00:08:43.655 --> 00:08:46.525
You love the military the way
you love the Constitution

00:08:46.525 --> 00:08:48.727
and the Bible --
only when it serves you,

00:08:48.727 --> 00:08:50.395
and that is not love.

00:08:50.395 --> 00:08:54.533
Which you would know if you
[bleep] finished "Michael."

00:08:54.533 --> 00:08:57.670
He had a message for you!

00:08:57.670 --> 00:08:59.238
And now we're seeing
what happens

00:08:59.238 --> 00:09:01.706
when a rotten-brained Boomer
who glorifies violence

00:09:01.706 --> 00:09:04.076
is in charge of the most
powerful military in the world.

00:09:04.076 --> 00:09:07.112
Yesterday, he shout at governors
on a phone call that they needed

00:09:07.112 --> 00:09:09.714
to dominate protesters
with mass arrests.

00:09:09.714 --> 00:09:10.983
-You have to dominate.

00:09:10.983 --> 00:09:12.885
If you don't dominate,
you're wasting your time.

00:09:12.885 --> 00:09:14.120
They're going to run over you,

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:16.321
you're going to look like
a bunch of jerks.

00:09:16.321 --> 00:09:18.524
You have to dominate.

00:09:18.524 --> 00:09:21.327
And you have to arrest people,

00:09:21.327 --> 00:09:22.895
and you have to try people.

00:09:22.895 --> 00:09:25.197
And they have to go to jail
for long periods of time.

00:09:25.197 --> 00:09:26.832
You're making a mistake because
you're making yourself

00:09:26.832 --> 00:09:29.635
look like -- look like fools.

00:09:29.635 --> 00:09:32.204
-First of all, there's
no deader giveaway

00:09:32.204 --> 00:09:35.708
that you're the villain
than using the word "fools."

00:09:35.708 --> 00:09:37.142
You never hear someone say,

00:09:37.142 --> 00:09:40.012
"Make sure those refugees get
something warm to eat,

00:09:40.012 --> 00:09:41.981
you fools!"

00:09:41.981 --> 00:09:43.649
We can't just wait
until November

00:09:43.649 --> 00:09:44.883
and hope to vote Trump out.

00:09:44.883 --> 00:09:46.518
We need to stand up to him now

00:09:46.518 --> 00:09:48.486
to stop the country's
descent into authoritarianism

00:09:48.486 --> 00:09:49.755
before it's too late.

00:09:49.755 --> 00:09:51.223
This has been "A Closer Look."

00:09:51.223 --> 00:09:54.693
♪♪

00:09:54.693 --> 00:09:57.196
New York City is in crisis,
and City Harvest

00:09:57.196 --> 00:09:58.864
has been stepping up
to rescue and deliver

00:09:58.864 --> 00:10:01.199
more food to meet the increased
need in New York City.

00:10:01.199 --> 00:10:02.768
If you're watching this online,

00:10:02.768 --> 00:10:04.269
you can hit
the "donate" button.

00:10:04.269 --> 00:10:08.074
Stay safe. Wash your hands.
We love you.

